  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>【年度收官战】-当前基础数据情况<br />活动目标：活动钻石消耗达1.84E钻石<br />目标完成度：活动消耗达1.69e<strong>钻石</strong>，目标完成度为91.93%。<br />消耗情况：普通礼物消耗1.07e钻，非礼物消耗28438w钻，小映礼物消耗2559w钻，特殊礼物消耗718w钻，活动消耗占比大盘消耗的32.68%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的46.41%；<br />核心参与人群：派对侧收礼的主播主要集中在SB层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中SB层级；<br />派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在SB层级；<br />互动玩法的主要参与集中在BDE层级用户。</p><p><br /></p><p>Hi&nbsp; &nbsp;all</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">《2026开好运》活动于1月1日0点-1月4日24点上线，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">现同步Day3数据情况：</span></p><p>具体数据如下：<br /><strong>1、活动目标完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达<strong>2800万钻石</strong><br />目标完成度：活动消耗达2363万<strong>钻石</strong>，目标完成度为84%。</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>项目</td><td>目标值</td><td>活动消耗</td><td>目标完成度</td><td>时间进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>年度收官战</td><td>28,000,000</td><td>23,632,685</td><td>84.40%</td><td>75%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>消耗情况：普通礼物消耗1949万钻，特殊礼物消耗378w钻。</p><p><strong>2、大盘数据情况：</strong></p><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的19.87%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的32.09%；</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td colspan=\"8\">每日数据情况</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>主板消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>活动消耗</td><td>普通礼物消耗</td><td>特殊礼物消耗</td><td>活动占主板</td><td>礼物消耗占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月1日</td><td>49,896,191&nbsp;</td><td>33,985,182&nbsp;</td><td>11,157,539&nbsp;</td><td>9,583,539&nbsp;</td><td>1,574,000&nbsp;</td><td>22.36%</td><td>32.83%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月2日</td><td>34,011,846&nbsp;</td><td>18,631,097&nbsp;</td><td>6,292,325&nbsp;</td><td>5,066,125&nbsp;</td><td>1,226,200&nbsp;</td><td>18.50%</td><td>33.77%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月3日</td><td>35,015,791&nbsp;</td><td>21,025,392&nbsp;</td><td>6,182,821&nbsp;</td><td>5,200,021&nbsp;</td><td>982,800&nbsp;</td><td>17.66%</td><td>29.41%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>合计</td><td>118,923,828&nbsp;</td><td>73,641,671&nbsp;</td><td>23,632,685&nbsp;</td><td>19,849,685&nbsp;</td><td>3,783,000&nbsp;</td><td>19.87%</td><td>32.09%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>主播收礼：</strong></p><p>全部礼物，派对和秀场主播的收礼占比为：67:33，派对侧送礼钻石数1576万钻，主播侧收礼钻石数786万钻。</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 57.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 60.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 81.2pt;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼场景</td><td>送礼钻石数</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对</td><td>15,763,924&nbsp;</td><td>66.70%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秀场</td><td>7,868,761&nbsp;</td><td>33.30%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>23,632,685&nbsp;</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>3、各层级主播收礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧收礼的主播主要集中在BN层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中B层级。</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 59.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 82.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 56.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 82.8pt;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>主播61日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>1912088</td><td>9.54%</td><td>1597014</td><td>7.97%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>866531</td><td>4.32%</td><td>829228</td><td>4.14%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>3672794</td><td>18.33%</td><td>2811663</td><td>14.03%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B-</td><td>1987184</td><td>9.92%</td><td>423141</td><td>2.11%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>1704848</td><td>8.51%</td><td>415275</td><td>2.07%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>725448</td><td>3.62%</td><td>135955</td><td>0.68%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>2952186</td><td>14.73%</td><td>5480</td><td>0.03%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>13821079</td><td>68.97%</td><td>6217756</td><td>31.03%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4、各层级用户送礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在B层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 32.2887%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 33.9663%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.8701%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 14.7187%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.8701%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 13.5865%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>用户25日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>241062</td><td>1.02%</td><td>1429481</td><td>6.05%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>939135</td><td>3.97%</td><td>1231993</td><td>5.21%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>6138424</td><td>25.97%</td><td>2421978</td><td>10.25%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>1921487</td><td>8.13%</td><td>790073</td><td>3.34%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>3633322</td><td>15.37%</td><td>1170428</td><td>4.95%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>E</td><td>2296194</td><td>9.72%</td><td>600334</td><td>2.54%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>F</td><td>472526</td><td>2.00%</td><td>76702</td><td>0.32%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>121774</td><td>0.52%</td><td>147772</td><td>0.63%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>15763924</td><td>66.70%</td><td>7868761</td><td>33.30%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>5、</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td>12<span>月份宝剑炼化日均消耗</span></td><td>1<span>月份宝剑炼化日均消耗</span></td><td>差值</td><td>环比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对</td><td>434,233&nbsp;</td><td>681,700&nbsp;</td><td>247,467&nbsp;</td><td>56.99%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秀场</td><td>527,633&nbsp;</td><td>579,300&nbsp;</td><td>51,667&nbsp;</td><td>9.79%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>961,867&nbsp;</td><td>1,261,000&nbsp;</td><td>299,133&nbsp;</td><td>31.10%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
